WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.829
This slide focuses on Parameters receive values
Start with the meaning of the idea

00:00:06.079 --> 00:00:11.705
then connect it to the example and to analytical
work A parameter is

00:00:11.732 --> 00:00:17.418
